translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.title	Autoapprover rules
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.help	Choose which pull requests Autoapprover evaluates. It runs on every push.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.empty	No Autoapprover rules yet
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.emptyDescription	Rules choose which pull requests Autoapprover evaluates and approves on your behalf.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.addRule	Add Autoapprover rule
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.deleteRuleDescription	Autoapprover will no longer run on pull requests matched only by this rule.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.exclusionsTitle	Autoapprover exclusions
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.exclusionsHelp	Autoapprover never runs on PRs that match an exclusion, even if a rule enrolls them. Automatic analysis is not affected.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.addExclusion	Add Autoapprover exclusion
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.deleteExclusionDescription	Autoapprover may run on pull requests matched by this exclusion after it is deleted.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.alwaysApproveTitle	Always approve
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.alwaysApproveHelp	Autoapprover approves matching pull requests without judging them, unless a finding is open or the approval policy changed. A file condition must match every changed file.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.alwaysApproveManagersOnly	View only. Only the account's Review managers change which pull requests are always approved.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.noAlwaysApprove	No Always approve rules yet
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.addAlwaysApprove	Always approve rule
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.addAlwaysApproveDescription	Approve pull requests in a repository or that match conditions without judging them.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.deleteAlwaysApproveDescription	Autoapprover judges pull requests matched only by this rule after it is deleted.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.neverApproveTitle	Always deny
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.neverApproveHelp	Autoapprover leaves matching pull requests to a person without judging them. Always deny wins over Always approve.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.noNeverApprove	No Always deny rules yet
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.addNeverApprove	Always deny rule
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.addNeverApproveDescription	Leave pull requests in a repository or that match conditions to a person.
translation.scopedTriggers.mergeManager.deleteNeverApproveDescription	Autoapprover may approve pull requests matched by this rule after it is deleted.
